Rule 1 (dropout probability must be between 0 and 1)
{v_1 : float} |= 0 ≤ v_1 ∧ v_1 ≤ 1
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must have a floating-point dtype: 6–8)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 3 (all tensor dimensions are non-negative, for any rank)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 8 (in-place operation requires a floating-point input tensor)
{v_1 : bool, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 then 6 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 8
